#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-m8p.rst:11
#: 6bc9b69d28e945e986ce7c3b392c14b4
msgid "The `Holybro H-RTK M8P GNSS <http://www.holybro.com/product/h-rtk-m8p-rover-lite/>`_  is an RTK GNSS module for mass market by Holybro. This family is similar to the :ref:`common-holybro-rtk-f9p` family but uses the smaller, lighter, and less expensive M8P Ublox RTK GNSS module which still provides far superior position resolution than previous generations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-m8p.rst:13
#: c543ddcd408c444097bd2fcd600bfa16
msgid "Using RTK allows ArduPilot to get its position with centimeter-level accuracy, which is much more accurate than can be provided by a normal GPS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-m8p.rst:15
#: 59a4b940c883442dbdc01483f237a799
